  "notes": "HSTX 22-pin FPC port: the inset lists 14 names (CKN, CKP, D0N, D0P, D1N, D1P, D2N, D2P, D11, D10, SCL, SDA, 3.3V, GND) with leader lines that do not reach individual contacts of the 22 drawn contacts, so physical positions cannot be assigned; not transcribed. On the board drawing the QT connector dots run grey, red, blue, yellow from top (reverse of the inset order). LED, NEOPIXEL are on-board."
